    "sentence_translations": [
      "Germany's also has a Shaolin Temple",
      "",
      "What is a Shaolin Temple?",
      "A Shaolin Temple is a place for training Kung Fu.",
      "There is a Shaolin Temple in Berlin, Germany as well.",
      "The head monk is called Shi Yong Chuan, has lived in Germany for 15 years and speaks Chinese and German.",
      "",
      "Master Shi Yong Chuan teaches people how to train Kung Fu at the Shaolin Temple in Germany.",
      "His youngest students are only 5 years old, and the oldest are over 80.",
      "Master Shi Yong Chuang says: “As long as you want to learn Kung Fu, you can come and study.”",
      "Now this Shaolin temple has many students every day.",
      "Everyone is training Kung Fu, drinking tea and making friends in the temple."
    ]
